    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Central in the city!\n\n71 Saint James`s Wood, South Circular Road, Dublin 8 is a generous two bedroom apartment with parking. Built c. 2001, this is a quality Cosgrave development and continues to be hugely popular with buyers. \n\nNo. 71 is a top floor property extending to approx. 75 sq.m / 807 sq.ft. It boasts a fantastic level of natural light due to its dual aspect, whilst the large sittingroom benefits from a sunny southerly aspect overlooking immaculately presented and well planted communal grounds.\n\nSaint James`s Wood is perfectly positioned on the South Circular Road in Dublin 8, close to the city centre, LUAS, Kilmainham and Rialto villages, the New Children`s Hospital, IMMA ( Irish Museum of Modern Art) and a host of local amenities and services including parks, schools, shops and restaurants.\n\nAccommodation briefly comprises: a large entrance hallway with storage room, bathroom with skylight window, fitted kitchen also with skylight window, large open plan living room / dining room and two double bedrooms. \n\nContact Michael in Young`s Estate Agents to arrange your viewing.\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Notice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Two bedroom top floor apartment </li><li> Secure Parking </li><li> Southerly aspect with wooden flooring throughout </li><li> Fantastic natural light throughout </li><li> 75 sq.m / 807 sq. ft approx </li><li> Electric heating/Management fees 1800 p.a approx. </li><li> Superbly presented throughout/Well maintained and landscaped communal grounds </li><li> Secure gated entry from South Circular Road </li><li> Six minute walk approx. to LUAS/Furniture and white goods included </li><li> Excellent storage</li></ul>"
      },
